 "descripcion": "Sam and Jess ran to the car through the snow. From the attic window, something tall waved goodbye. The sheriff knew this house.\n\nWould you ever go back?\n\nNarrated fiction. New part every day.\n#horror #horrorstories #scarystories #survival #creepypasta",
